# Natural Selection

=== layout: one-panel

# *Natural Selection*

@body

- Allele frequencies change systematically in populations because of [*differential survival and reproduction*]{color=#8D281E} among genotypes.
  - Natural selection is selection for survival and reproduction in the face of [*competition*]{color=#8D281E}.
- Natural selection is the mechanism that changes the physical and behavioral characteristics of a species.

=== layout: one-panel
@replaceme


@body

- *Observation #1\:* Members of a population often vary in their inherited traits

