| Genotype | [AA]{background-color=#999999 text-align=center} | [Aa]{background-color=#999999 text-align=center} | [aa]{background-color=#EEEEEE text-align=center} |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Phenotype | [dark]{background-color=#999999 text-align=center} | [dark]{background-color=#999999 text-align=center} | [light]{background-color=#EEEEEE text-align=center} |
